{
  "name": "gc14-14.8-understand-linux",
  "lesson": "14.0, 14.8 (Google Cloud stream)",
  "title": "Lab GC14, part 1: get the lab, look at ExampleCo's Agent Runtime deployment (today and hardened), and see each Agent Platform piece on its own with explore.py (map, identity, iam, user, registry, gateway, armor, memory, sandbox, logs) before running the decision table; then single rows of the decision table read control by control",
